{"id":"c499cd9b67724dcb","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/357_线性类型论_Linear_Type_Theory.md","title":"357 线性类型论 Linear Type Theory","display":"357_线性类型论_Linear_Type_Theory","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"357-线性类型论-Linear-Type-Theory\">357 线性类型论 Linear Type Theory</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。固定可数无限变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{L}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}_{L}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 与可数基本类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Base}_{L}\">\\(\\mathsf{Base}_{L}\\)</span>。线性上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L}\">\\(\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L}\\)</span> 的元素是有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:A\">\\(x:A\\)</span>，变量名不得重复，声明类型属于Ty。dom 返回名字集，空列记∅；追加 x:A 只在 x∉domΔ 时定义。Var/Base/Ty/Tm/LCtx 是本篇带 L 下标载体的简称。上下文分裂关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dom(\\Delta_1)\">\\(dom(\\Delta_1)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dom(\\Delta_2)\">\\(dom(\\Delta_2)\\)</span> 不交，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 是保留二者所有声明、允许有限交换的合并序列；精确关系在第6节唯一定义。判断集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Jud}_{L}=\\{\n\\Delta\\vdash M:A:\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L},M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{L},A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Jud}_{L}=\\{\n\\Delta\\vdash M:A:\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L},M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{L},A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-类型构造子\">2. 类型构造子</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{L}\">\\(b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{L}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(b\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\multimap B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(A\\multimap B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\otimes B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(A\\otimes B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 1\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(\\mathbf 1\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\&amp; B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(A\\&amp; B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\">\\(!A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-项构造子\">3. 项构造子</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{L}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{L}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^\\ell x.M\">\\(\\lambda^\\ell x.M\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\,N\">\\(M\\,N\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\otimes N\">\\(M\\otimes N\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne y\">\\(x\\ne y\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N)\">\\(\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N)\\)</span> 是项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 中绑定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\">\\(\\star\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}\">\\(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(M)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(M)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{bang}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{bang}(M)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letBang}(x,M,N)\">\\(\\mathsf{letBang}(x,M,N)\\)</span> 是项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 中绑定。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三个显示坐标是完整标签 term(Δ,M,A)，base返回Δ；没有独立的type判断或辅助type公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-完整结构动作与联合绑定\">4. 完整结构动作与联合绑定</h1>\n<p>对所有项定义孩子列：变量与 star 为空；λx.M 为⟨M⟩；app、tensor、加性pair为⟨M,N⟩；fst&amp;、snd&amp;、bang为⟨M⟩；letTensor(x,y,M,N)与letBang(x,M,N)为⟨M,N⟩。绑定边 bind(E,k) 在 λ 的k=0为{x}，letTensor的k=1为{x,y}，letBang的k=1为{x}，其它合法边为空。此表覆盖全部11种项构造子，记孩子函数为 child_L。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_L(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_L(\\star)=\\varnothing,\\quad BV_L(x)=BV_L(\\star)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_L(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_L(\\star)=\\varnothing,\\quad BV_L(x)=BV_L(\\star)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_L(E)=\\bigcup_{k&lt;|child_L(E)|}(FV_L(child_L(E)_k)\\setminus bind(E,k)),\\quad\nBV_L(E)=\\bigcup_{k&lt;|child_L(E)|}(BV_L(child_L(E)_k)\\cup bind(E,k))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_L(E)=\\bigcup_{k&lt;|child_L(E)|}(FV_L(child_L(E)_k)\\setminus bind(E,k)),\\quad\nBV_L(E)=\\bigcup_{k&lt;|child_L(E)|}(BV_L(child_L(E)_k)\\cup bind(E,k))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>用于非叶。两种加性投影因此明确继承孩子FV/BV。</p>\n<p>对有限 X⊆Var，freshL(X) 取枚举中最小未出现名字。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_L:Tm\\times Var\\times Tm\\to Tm\">\\(Sub_L:Tm\\times Var\\times Tm\\to Tm\\)</span> 记为 E[x:=N]，反向 E[N/x] 为同一值。变量命中返回N，未命中保留原名，star恒等。app、tensor、加性pair、fst&amp;、snd&amp;、bang逐个孩子递归。</p>\n<p>一名绑定体返回新名与体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BSub_L(y,E,x,N)=\\begin{cases}(y,E),&amp;y=x,\\\\\n(y,E[x:=N]),&amp;y\\ne x,y\\notin FV(N),\\\\\n(z,E[y:=z][x:=N]),&amp;y\\ne x,y\\in FV(N),\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BSub_L(y,E,x,N)=\\begin{cases}(y,E),&amp;y=x,\\\\\n(y,E[x:=N]),&amp;y\\ne x,y\\notin FV(N),\\\\\n(z,E[y:=z][x:=N]),&amp;y\\ne x,y\\in FV(N),\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=fresh_L(FV(E)\\cup BV(E)\\cup FV(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=fresh_L(FV(E)\\cup BV(E)\\cup FV(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。若输出(y′,E′)，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda^\\ell y.E)[x:=N]=\\lambda^\\ell y&#39;.E&#39;,\\quad\nletBang(y,M,E)[x:=N]=letBang(y&#39;,M[x:=N],E&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\lambda^\\ell y.E)[x:=N]=\\lambda^\\ell y&#39;.E&#39;,\\quad\nletBang(y,M,E)[x:=N]=letBang(y&#39;,M[x:=N],E&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限并行替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PSub(E,(b_i)_{i&lt;n},(N_i)_{i&lt;n})\">\\(PSub(E,(b_i)_{i&lt;n},(N_i)_{i&lt;n})\\)</span> 要求旧名互异、实参皆为Tm。令H=FV(E)∪BV(E)∪{b_i:i&lt;n}∪⋃i FV(N_i)，按顺序唯一取t_i=fresh_L(H∪{t_j:j&lt;i})；先逐次b_i:=t_i，再逐次t_i:=N_i。空列返回E。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PRen(E,\\bar b,\\bar c)=PSub(E,\\bar b,\\bar c)\">\\(PRen(E,\\bar b,\\bar c)=PSub(E,\\bar b,\\bar c)\\)</span>，两名字列各自互异；名字本来就是项。</p>\n<p>二名绑定体要求y≠z，定义唯一一次联合操作：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BSub2_L(y,z,E,x,N)=\n\\begin{cases}(y,z,E),&amp;x\\in\\{y,z\\},\\\\\n(y,z,E[x:=N]),&amp;x\\notin\\{y,z\\},\\{y,z\\}\\cap FV(N)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n(y&#39;,z&#39;,PRen(E,(y,z),(y&#39;,z&#39;))[x:=N]),&amp;\\text{其它情况},\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BSub2_L(y,z,E,x,N)=\n\\begin{cases}(y,z,E),&amp;x\\in\\{y,z\\},\\\\\n(y,z,E[x:=N]),&amp;x\\notin\\{y,z\\},\\{y,z\\}\\cap FV(N)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n(y&#39;,z&#39;,PRen(E,(y,z),(y&#39;,z&#39;))[x:=N]),&amp;\\text{其它情况},\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最后一支的y′/z′依次用fresh选择，避开FV(E)∪BV(E)∪FV(N)∪{x,y,z}及先选名。于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"letTensor(y,z,M,E)[x:=N]=letTensor(y&#39;,z&#39;,M[x:=N],E&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{当 }BSub2_L(y,z,E,x,N)=(y&#39;,z&#39;,E&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[letTensor(y,z,M,E)[x:=N]=letTensor(y&#39;,z&#39;,M[x:=N],E&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{当 }BSub2_L(y,z,E,x,N)=(y&#39;,z&#39;,E&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不会对已经插入的N再执行一次x替换；遮蔽时仍替换外部输入M。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^L\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^L\\)</span> 是Tm²上包含如下改名、且对同根标签/同静态参数/同绑定名的对应孩子相容的最小等价关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>λ与letBang分别只改其绑定体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV(E)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin FV(E)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span> 时把x改y并把体E改E[x:=y]</li>\n<li>letTensor的(x,y)同时改为互异(x′,y′)，新名与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV(E)\\setminus\\{x,y\\}\">\\(FV(E)\\setminus\\{x,y\\}\\)</span> 不相交；只把绑定体改为PRen(E,(x,y),(x′,y′))，输入项保持</li>\n</ul>\n<p>变量叶名、star标签和投影编号是静态数据，不能凭空孩子列等同不同变量。全关系满足要求，最小关系可取交集。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-根归约与全部项位置\">5. 根归约与全部项位置</h1>\n<p>根关系恰为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nRoot_L={}&amp;\\{((\\lambda^\\ell x.M)N,M[x:=N])\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(letTensor(x,y,M_1\\otimes M_2,N),PSub(N,(x,y),(M_1,M_2))):x\\ne y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(fst_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}),M),(snd_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}),N)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(letBang(x,bang(M),N),N[x:=M])\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nRoot_L={}&amp;\\{((\\lambda^\\ell x.M)N,M[x:=N])\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(letTensor(x,y,M_1\\otimes M_2,N),PSub(N,(x,y),(M_1,M_2))):x\\ne y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(fst_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}),M),(snd_{\\&amp;}(\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}),N)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(letBang(x,bang(M),N),N[x:=M])\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全部自由模式参数取Var/Tm对应载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_L^0=Root_L\">\\(\\to_L^0=Root_L\\)</span>。张量β同时替换两个字段，不让M1中的自由y被第二次替换改写。</p>\n<p>StepCertL 为最小有限证书集合：root(M,N)当(M,N)∈RootL；若c的端点为M/N，对child_L表任一非叶根选唯一孩子位置k，保持根绑定名及其它孩子，在该位置分别装M/N，所得两根是ctx(k,其它数据,c)的端点。src/tgt按这两条递归定义。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\to_L N\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\in StepCert_L\\ (src(c)=M\\land tgt(c)=N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\to_L N\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\in StepCert_L\\ (src(c)=M\\land tgt(c)=N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>表中的全部14个项孩子位置均允许，不把绑定名字或类型当成额外项槽。原始一步没有自动传递闭包；本篇也不额外加入未声明的指数弱化/收缩计算。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-本地规则与有限资源关系\">6. 本地规则与有限资源关系</h1>\n<p>所有规则builder只取Jud*×Jud中的实例；因此扩展中的x/y须为上下文新名，letTensor须x≠y。原始各族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\mathsf{var}}\n=\n\\{((),x:A\\vdash x:A):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L},A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\mathsf{var}}\n=\n\\{((),x:A\\vdash x:A):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L},A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\multimap}\n=\n\\{((\\Delta,x:A\\vdash M:B),\\Delta\\vdash\\lambda^\\ell x.M:A\\multimap B)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\multimap B,\\Delta_2\\vdash N:A),\\Delta\\vdash MN:B):\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\multimap}\n=\n\\{((\\Delta,x:A\\vdash M:B),\\Delta\\vdash\\lambda^\\ell x.M:A\\multimap B)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\multimap B,\\Delta_2\\vdash N:A),\\Delta\\vdash MN:B):\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\otimes}\n=\n\\{((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A,\\Delta_2\\vdash N:B),\\Delta\\vdash M\\otimes N:A\\otimes B):\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\otimes B,\\Delta_2,x:A,y:B\\vdash N:C),\n\\Delta\\vdash\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N):C):\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\otimes}\n=\n\\{((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A,\\Delta_2\\vdash N:B),\\Delta\\vdash M\\otimes N:A\\otimes B):\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:A\\otimes B,\\Delta_2,x:A,y:B\\vdash N:C),\n\\Delta\\vdash\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N):C):\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\&amp;}\n=\n\\{((\\Delta\\vdash M:A,\\Delta\\vdash N:B),\\Delta\\vdash\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}:A\\&amp; B)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta\\vdash P:A\\&amp; B),\\Delta\\vdash\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(P):A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta\\vdash P:A\\&amp; B),\\Delta\\vdash\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(P):B)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\&amp;}\n=\n\\{((\\Delta\\vdash M:A,\\Delta\\vdash N:B),\\Delta\\vdash\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&amp;}:A\\&amp; B)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta\\vdash P:A\\&amp; B),\\Delta\\vdash\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&amp;}(P):A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta\\vdash P:A\\&amp; B),\\Delta\\vdash\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&amp;}(P):B)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,!}\n=\n\\{((\\varnothing\\vdash M:A),\\varnothing\\vdash\\mathsf{bang}(M):!A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:!A,\\Delta_2,x:A\\vdash N:B),\\Delta\\vdash\\mathsf{letBang}(x,M,N):B):\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,!}\n=\n\\{((\\varnothing\\vdash M:A),\\varnothing\\vdash\\mathsf{bang}(M):!A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Delta_1\\vdash M:!A,\\Delta_2,x:A\\vdash N:B),\\Delta\\vdash\\mathsf{letBang}(x,M,N):B):\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>单位关系在下文唯一定义。不存在关系元素的前提或结论把未使用变量从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 删除，也不存在把同一变量复制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_1\">\\(\\Delta_1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Delta_2\\)</span> 的分裂；这两条排除即为无弱化和无收缩的形式条件。</p>\n<p>资源序列连接是有类型关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCat}_{L}\n=\\{(\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,\\Delta):\n\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L},\\\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1{}^\\frown\\Delta_2,\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta_1)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta_2)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCat}_{L}\n=\\{(\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,\\Delta):\n\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L},\\\n\\Delta=\\Delta_1{}^\\frown\\Delta_2,\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta_1)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta_2)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一次相邻交换与其有限闭包分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ExchStep}_{L}\n=\\{(\\Gamma_0{}^\\frown\\langle x:A,y:B\\rangle{}^\\frown\\Gamma_1,\n\\Gamma_0{}^\\frown\\langle y:B,x:A\\rangle{}^\\frown\\Gamma_1):x\\ne y\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ExchStep}_{L}\n=\\{(\\Gamma_0{}^\\frown\\langle x:A,y:B\\rangle{}^\\frown\\Gamma_1,\n\\Gamma_0{}^\\frown\\langle y:B,x:A\\rangle{}^\\frown\\Gamma_1):x\\ne y\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Perm}_{L}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\rho:n+1\\to\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L}\\\n(\\rho_0=\\Delta\\land\\rho_n=\\Delta&#39;\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\rho_i,\\rho_{i+1})\\in\n\\mathsf{ExchStep}_{L}\\cup\\mathsf{ExchStep}_{L}^{-1})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Perm}_{L}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\rho:n+1\\to\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L}\\\n(\\rho_0=\\Delta\\land\\rho_n=\\Delta&#39;\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\rho_i,\\rho_{i+1})\\in\n\\mathsf{ExchStep}_{L}\\cup\\mathsf{ExchStep}_{L}^{-1})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>分裂关系由连接与交换的有限见证精确定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ndom(\\Delta_1)\\cap dom(\\Delta_2)=\\varnothing\n\\wedge\n\\exists\\Delta_{12}\\ ((\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,\\Delta_{12})\\in\\mathsf{LCat}_{L}\n\\land\\operatorname{Perm}_{L}(\\Delta,\\Delta_{12})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ndom(\\Delta_1)\\cap dom(\\Delta_2)=\\varnothing\n\\wedge\n\\exists\\Delta_{12}\\ ((\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,\\Delta_{12})\\in\\mathsf{LCat}_{L}\n\\land\\operatorname{Perm}_{L}(\\Delta,\\Delta_{12})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>交换规则是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\mathsf{exch}}\n=\n\\{((\\Delta\\vdash M:A),\\Delta&#39;\\vdash M:A):\n\\operatorname{Perm}_{L}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\mathsf{exch}}\n=\n\\{((\\Delta\\vdash M:A),\\Delta&#39;\\vdash M:A):\n\\operatorname{Perm}_{L}(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>单位规则命名为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\mathbf 1}\n=\n\\{((),\\varnothing\\vdash\\star:\\mathbf 1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\mathbf 1}\n=\n\\{((),\\varnothing\\vdash\\star:\\mathbf 1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\">\\(\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\)</span> 的规则均要求分裂后的两个上下文域不相交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\mathsf{exch}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Raw}_{L,\\mathsf{exch}}\\)</span> 只重排资源，不删除资源，也不复制资源。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-有限分配证书与携证书推导\">7. 有限分配证书与携证书推导</h1>\n<p>令 PermCert_L(Δ,Δ′) 为第6节 Perm 定义所用的完整有限上下文列 ⟨ρ0,…,ρn⟩：首末是Δ/Δ′，每一步属于 ExchStep 或其逆。每个ρi必须属于LCtx，n=0允许恒等；所以 Perm 当且仅当 PermCert 非空。</p>\n<p>ConsumeStep_L 是两个关系的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{((\\langle x:A\\rangle^\\frown U,L,R),(U,L^\\frown\\langle x:A\\rangle,R))\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\langle x:A\\rangle^\\frown U,L,R),(U,L,R^\\frown\\langle x:A\\rangle))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{((\\langle x:A\\rangle^\\frown U,L,R),(U,L^\\frown\\langle x:A\\rangle,R))\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\langle x:A\\rangle^\\frown U,L,R),(U,L,R^\\frown\\langle x:A\\rangle))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中U/L/R各自为LCtx、定义域两两不交，x不在其域并中。分裂证书包含消费列和两个最终交换见证：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nSplitCert_L(\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2)=\\{(\\sigma,\\pi_L,\\pi_R):{}&amp;\n\\sigma=((U_j,L_j,R_j))_{j\\le n},\\ n\\in\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&amp;(U_0,L_0,R_0)=(\\Delta,\\varnothing,\\varnothing),\\ U_n=\\varnothing,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall j&lt;n\\ (\\sigma_j,\\sigma_{j+1})\\in ConsumeStep_L,\\\\\n&amp;\\pi_L\\in PermCert_L(L_n,\\Delta_1),\\ \\pi_R\\in PermCert_L(R_n,\\Delta_2)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nSplitCert_L(\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2)=\\{(\\sigma,\\pi_L,\\pi_R):{}&amp;\n\\sigma=((U_j,L_j,R_j))_{j\\le n},\\ n\\in\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&amp;(U_0,L_0,R_0)=(\\Delta,\\varnothing,\\varnothing),\\ U_n=\\varnothing,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall j&lt;n\\ (\\sigma_j,\\sigma_{j+1})\\in ConsumeStep_L,\\\\\n&amp;\\pi_L\\in PermCert_L(L_n,\\Delta_1),\\ \\pi_R\\in PermCert_L(R_n,\\Delta_2)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每步删除一个未消费声明并保留类型/名字，故n=|Δ|。从证书可读出域不交和全部声明恰一次；反向给定#的有限交换/连接见证，按每个声明最终属于Δ1或Δ2选择消费方向，再用相邻交换整理两条输出列。因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\#_L\\Delta_2\\Longleftrightarrow SplitCert_L(\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\#_L\\Delta_2\\Longleftrightarrow SplitCert_L(\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>节点见证W有以下三类有限数据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>plain(r)，r分别是var、lam、unit、addPair、addFst、addSnd、bangIntro；匹配第6节同名根构造对应的那一个不含#的原始模式</li>\n<li>split(r,Δ,Δ1,Δ2,C)，r∈{app,tensorIntro,tensorElim,bangElim}，且C∈SplitCert_L(Δ,Δ1,Δ2)</li>\n<li>perm(π)，π∈PermCert_L(Δ,Δ′)，用于唯一交换模式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>定义RuleInst_L⊆Jud*×Jud×W。plain分支要求相同raw模式的全部类型/项/上下文坐标逐字匹配。split分支还必须匹配以下完整资源接口：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{c|c|c|c}\nr&amp;\\text{首前提环境}&amp;\\text{次前提环境}&amp;\\text{结论项与环境}\\\\\\hline\napp&amp;\\Delta_1&amp;\\Delta_2&amp;\\Delta\\vdash MN:B\\\\\ntensorIntro&amp;\\Delta_1&amp;\\Delta_2&amp;\\Delta\\vdash M\\otimes N:A\\otimes B\\\\\ntensorElim&amp;\\Delta_1&amp;\\Delta_2,x:A,y:B&amp;\\Delta\\vdash letTensor(x,y,M,N):C_0\\\\\nbangElim&amp;\\Delta_1&amp;\\Delta_2,x:A&amp;\\Delta\\vdash letBang(x,M,N):B\n\\end{array}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{array}{c|c|c|c}\nr&amp;\\text{首前提环境}&amp;\\text{次前提环境}&amp;\\text{结论项与环境}\\\\\\hline\napp&amp;\\Delta_1&amp;\\Delta_2&amp;\\Delta\\vdash MN:B\\\\\ntensorIntro&amp;\\Delta_1&amp;\\Delta_2&amp;\\Delta\\vdash M\\otimes N:A\\otimes B\\\\\ntensorElim&amp;\\Delta_1&amp;\\Delta_2,x:A,y:B&amp;\\Delta\\vdash letTensor(x,y,M,N):C_0\\\\\nbangElim&amp;\\Delta_1&amp;\\Delta_2,x:A&amp;\\Delta\\vdash letBang(x,M,N):B\n\\end{array}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每行必须同时满足第6节对应原始模式的全部项与类型坐标，不只是这张环境表；tensorElim从次前提删去其确切末尾x:A/y:B后得到Δ2，不能把两个绑定字段也当作父节点资源分配。perm分支要求π的首末为前提/结论环境，项与类型保持相同。没有其它RuleInst成员。</p>\n<p>最终</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_L=\\{(\\vec J,J):\\exists w\\in W\\ (\\vec J,J,w)\\in RuleInst_L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_L=\\{(\\vec J,J):\\exists w\\in W\\ (\\vec J,J,w)\\in RuleInst_L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这就是原始七族的并集，但每个实际分配/交换节点都保存上述有限见证。原始var、exch、multimap、tensor、unit、additive、bang族的实际名称 Rule_{L,k} 分别取此投影中对应模式的子关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"AxJdg_L=\\{x:A\\vdash x:A:x\\in Var,A\\in Ty\\}\\cup\\{\\varnothing\\vdash\\star:\\mathbf1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[AxJdg_L=\\{x:A\\vdash x:A:x\\in Var,A\\in Ty\\}\\cup\\{\\varnothing\\vdash\\star:\\mathbf1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它恰为Rule的空前提投影；删除旧稿不属于Jud的辅助base type标签，不引入额外Type判断。</p>\n<p>TreeDom_L 为非空有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in P,\\quad p^\\frown q\\in P\\Rightarrow p\\in P,\\quad\np^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in P\\Rightarrow\\forall j&lt;i\\ p^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\in P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\epsilon\\in P,\\quad p^\\frown q\\in P\\Rightarrow p\\in P,\\quad\np^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in P\\Rightarrow\\forall j&lt;i\\ p^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\in P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"arity_P(p)=|\\{i:p^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in P\\}|\">\\(arity_P(p)=|\\{i:p^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in P\\}|\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ch_P(p)=\\langle p^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\rangle_{i&lt;arity_P(p)}\">\\(ch_P(p)=\\langle p^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\rangle_{i&lt;arity_P(p)}\\)</span>。根ε无父，非根删末项有唯一父，长度增加排除环，前缀保证根可达。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Der_L=\\{(P,\\ell,\\omega):P\\in TreeDom_L,\\ell:P\\to Jud_L,\\omega:P\\to W,\n\\forall p\\in P\\ ((\\ell(q))_{q\\in ch_P(p)},\\ell(p),\\omega(p))\\in RuleInst_L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Der_L=\\{(P,\\ell,\\omega):P\\in TreeDom_L,\\ell:P\\to Jud_L,\\omega:P\\to W,\n\\forall p\\in P\\ ((\\ell(q))_{q\\in ch_P(p)},\\ell(p),\\omega(p))\\in RuleInst_L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"root(P,\\ell,\\omega)=\\ell(\\epsilon)\">\\(root(P,\\ell,\\omega)=\\ell(\\epsilon)\\)</span>。对给定D=(P,ell,ω)∈Der，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"ResAllocNode_L(D)=\\{(p,\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,C):p\\in P,\n\\omega(p)=split(r,\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,C)\\text{ 对某个上述四类r}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[ResAllocNode_L(D)=\\{(p,\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,C):p\\in P,\n\\omega(p)=split(r,\\Delta,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2,C)\\text{ 对某个上述四类r}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这包含张量消去节点。实际typing可导性为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_L M:A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists D\\in Der_L\\quad root(D)=term(\\Delta,M,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\vdash_L M:A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists D\\in Der_L\\quad root(D)=term(\\Delta,M,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个节点和叶都按同一个局部许可证检查；有限有序树可通过从根记录孩子索引同构为该固定地址表示。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-资源替换义务与目标范围\">8. 资源替换义务与目标范围</h1>\n<p>类型不含项名，因此替换上下文中的一个假设时其它声明类型原样。以下为明确开放的保型义务：对LCtx中的Γ1,x:A,Γ2、Σ、Ω，以及M/N和A/B，若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_1,x:A,\\Gamma_2\\vdash_L M:B,\\qquad \\Sigma\\vdash_L N:A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_1,x:A,\\Gamma_2\\vdash_L M:B,\\qquad \\Sigma\\vdash_L N:A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且x∉domΣ、domΣ与domΓ1∪domΓ2不交，并给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\in SplitCert_L(\\Omega,\\Gamma_1{}^\\frown\\Gamma_2,\\Sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\in SplitCert_L(\\Omega,\\Gamma_1{}^\\frown\\Gamma_2,\\Sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则希望构造M′及Ω⊢L M′:B的有限证明，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M&#39;\\equiv_\\alpha^L M[x:=N]\">\\(M&#39;\\equiv_\\alpha^L M[x:=N]\\)</span>。内部新绑定名可选为避开Ω的代表；不给定分裂证书时不声称可以复制或删除资源。</p>\n<p>同一义务在加性pair的两个前提中使用同一个替换后环境Ω；这正是原加性规则的接口，不是把Ω拆成两份乘法资源。bang引入仍只允许空环境，letBang的引入假设仍按现有线性上下文使用；本篇没有添加一般指数弱化/收缩。上述保型存在命题、归约保持和归一化均未由句法定义或有限样例自动证明。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Delta_L=(\\#_L,\\multimap,\\otimes,\\mathbf1,\\&amp;,!,letTensor,letBang,SplitCert_L,ResAllocNode_L,\\to_L^0),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Delta_L=(\\#_L,\\multimap,\\otimes,\\mathbf1,\\&amp;,!,letTensor,letBang,SplitCert_L,ResAllocNode_L,\\to_L^0),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{LTT}=(&amp;Var_L,Base_L,Ty_L,Tm_L,LCtx_L,dom,Jud_L,base,LCat_L,ExchStep_L,\nPermCert_L,Perm_L,ConsumeStep_L,SplitCert_L,\\#_L,\\\\\n&amp;child_L,bind,FV_L,BV_L,fresh_L,Sub_L,BSub_L,BSub2_L,PSub,PRen,\\equiv_\\alpha^L,\nRoot_L,StepCert_L,src,tgt,\\to_L^0,\\to_L,\\\\\n&amp;W,RuleInst_L,(Rule_{L,k})_k,Rule_L,AxJdg_L,TreeDom_L,arity,ch,root,Der_L,ResAllocNode_L,\n\\vdash_L,Delta_L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{LTT}=(&amp;Var_L,Base_L,Ty_L,Tm_L,LCtx_L,dom,Jud_L,base,LCat_L,ExchStep_L,\nPermCert_L,Perm_L,ConsumeStep_L,SplitCert_L,\\#_L,\\\\\n&amp;child_L,bind,FV_L,BV_L,fresh_L,Sub_L,BSub_L,BSub2_L,PSub,PRen,\\equiv_\\alpha^L,\nRoot_L,StepCert_L,src,tgt,\\to_L^0,\\to_L,\\\\\n&amp;W,RuleInst_L,(Rule_{L,k})_k,Rule_L,AxJdg_L,TreeDom_L,arity,ch,root,Der_L,ResAllocNode_L,\n\\vdash_L,Delta_L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有简称指本篇已定义对象。资源见证记录的是每个具体规则的分配，不用外部满足关系或泛称“线性”代替许可证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"357-线性类型论-Linear-Type-Theory","text":"357 线性类型论 Linear Type Theory","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-类型构造子","text":"2. 类型构造子","level":1},{"id":"3.-项构造子","text":"3. 项构造子","level":1},{"id":"4.-完整结构动作与联合绑定","text":"4. 完整结构动作与联合绑定","level":1},{"id":"5.-根归约与全部项位置","text":"5. 根归约与全部项位置","level":1},{"id":"6.-本地规则与有限资源关系","text":"6. 本地规则与有限资源关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-有限分配证书与携证书推导","text":"7. 有限分配证书与携证书推导","level":1},{"id":"8.-资源替换义务与目标范围","text":"8. 资源替换义务与目标范围","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{L}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Base}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"x:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta=\\Delta_1\\mathbin{\\#}_{L}\\Delta_2","display":false},{"tex":"dom(\\Delta_1)","display":false},{"tex":"dom(\\Delta_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Jud}_{L}=\\{\n\\Delta\\vdash M:A:\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{LCtx}_{L},M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{L},A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}\n\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\multimap B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\otimes B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 1\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\& B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"!A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^\\ell x.M","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"M\\,N","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"M\\otimes N","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ne y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{letTensor}(x,y,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\star","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle M,N\\rangle_{\\&}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{fst}_{\\&}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{snd}_{\\&}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{bang}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{letBang}(x,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"FV_L(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_L(\\star)=\\varnothing,\\quad BV_L(x)=BV_L(\\star)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"FV_L(E)=\\bigcup_{k<|child_L(E)|}(FV_L(child_L(E)_k)\\setminus bind(E,k)),\\quad\nBV_L(E)=\\bigcup_{k<|child_L(E)|}(BV_L(child_L(E)_k)\\cup bind(E,k))","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_L:Tm\\times Var\\times Tm\\to Tm","display":false},{"tex":"BSub_L(y,E,x,N)=\\begin{cases}(y,E),&y=x,\\\\\n(y,E[x:=N]),&y\\ne x,y\\notin FV(N),\\\\\n(z,E[y:=z][x:=N]),&y\\ne x,y\\in FV(N),\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"z=fresh_L(FV(E)\\cup BV(E)\\cup FV(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\})","display":false},{"tex":"(\\lambda^\\ell y.E)[x:=N]=\\lambda^\\ell y'.E',\\quad\nletBang(y,M,E)[x:=N]=letBang(y',M[x:=N],E').","display":true},{"tex":"PSub(E,(b_i)_{i<n},(N_i)_{i<n})","display":false},{"tex":"PRen(E,\\bar b,\\bar c)=PSub(E,\\bar b,\\bar c)","display":false},{"tex":"BSub2_L(y,z,E,x,N)=\n\\begin{cases}(y,z,E),&x\\in\\{y,z\\},\\\\\n(y,z,E[x:=N]),&x\\notin\\{y,z\\},\\{y,z\\}\\cap FV(N)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n(y',z',PRen(E,(y,z),(y',z'))[x:=N]),&\\text{其它情况},\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"letTensor(y,z,M,E)[x:=N]=letTensor(y',z',M[x:=N],E')\n\\quad\\text{当 }BSub2_L(y,z,E,x,N)=(y',z',E').","display":true},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha^L","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin FV(E)\\setminus\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"FV(E)\\setminus\\{x,y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nRoot_L={}&\\{((\\lambda^\\ell x.M)N,M[x:=N])\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(letTensor(x,y,M_1\\otimes M_2,N),PSub(N,(x,y),(M_1,M_2))):x\\ne y\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(fst_{\\&}(\\langle 